{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Joyquarium is a very stress - relieving idle game. You can raise fish manually or use the Auto - AFK function. Sell the grown fry to make money. You can also keep the adult fish in the fish tank to generate considerable income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy fry packs to unlock new fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/kabao.gif?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed the little fish and watch them eagerly scramble for food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/xuanchuan_1.gif?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock rare shiny and colorful forms! There's also a chance to raise a king fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/tujian.gif?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water wisteria, Rotala rotundifolia, Ludwigia repens, Hygrophila polysperma 'Roraima', Apistogramma viejita... A wide variety of aquatic plants, as well as driftwoods of different postures and strange - looking landscaping stones, are waiting for you to arrange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/20250123-184549_1.gif?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 13 cool filter effects are available for you to freely combine, and the visual effects are ever - changing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/1.gif?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 13 cool filter effects are available for you to freely combine, and the visual effects are ever - changing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472890/extras/music.png?t=1744952424\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ten - Thousand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/90b47705f8a82b7d5fc49d89aca1176087375671.jpg"},{"name":"Achieve a Small Goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/7390af71efd30f356f3383a8612bad8e53146ca8.jpg"},{"name":"Icy 4 Billion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/c0dc1ec48c00ca4d6ba9549952c5eee9697892b7.jpg"},{"name":"Trillion - Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/c44dc1a45a76f18390223bd61c959e98d8f877b2.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [First-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/bd2b75e14a711d3198de91380d6d7f217bc32929.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [Third-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/e41338afdd65d31e0887fe0911dbb4ee05a30e96.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [Third-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/57062e6252e07024815e1160685f21af85eab356.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [Fourth-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/94d387a5fec83c0ac958754c477aef41c2e20414.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [Fifth-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3472890/9cf1c65847a8eac6303a263495ef0961c7d079ae.jpg"},{"name":"Full Collection of [Sixth-class Fry]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/